Revision history for AnyEvent-App-PerlLive

0.01  2026-10-19
 - Initial CPAN release.
 - Persistent project-based Perl evaluation server.
 - Stream-framed UTF-8 protocol and JSON metadata protocol support.
 - Integration with AnyEvent (EV, Event, Perl event loops).
 - Model Context Protocol (MCP) server (perl-live-mcp.pl) for AI assistants.
 - Companion package for Emacs perl-live.el.
